      "statement": "AppSettings is a flat struct of serde-default sub-settings (appearance, proxy, scheduler, download, bt, logging, aria2_rpc, cdn_acceleration, url_rewrite, io_baseline and more), so a partial or hand-edited settings.json still loads and unknown keys are ignored.",
