      "statement": "The data directory is %LOCALAPPDATA%\\limedl on Windows, ~/Library/Application Support/limedl on macOS, $XDG_DATA_HOME/limedl or ~/.local/share/limedl on Linux, and LIMEDL_DATA_DIR overrides all of them.",
